      "writtenOn": "2021-10-04T18:09:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the Soong dependencies begets the make module dependencies that begets the ninja dependencies (except exceptions). The items #1-#5 is my understanding of how this chain is implemented with a combo of Soong and make logic. It\u0027s not how the dependencies are represented, which is as you describe.\n\nMy point is that I expect this to be more aligned with that existing chain of implementation logic, rather than what to me looks like a completely different way. I hope that would also avoid a new singleton.",
      "parentUuid": "f3b9c064_51ecd48d",
      "range": {
