      "writtenOn": "2021-10-05T10:49:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Soong supports Validation dependencies which should probably be used for this sort of check.\n\nIf rule X has a Validation dependency on path Y then while building X does not itself cause Y to be built, any dependency on X (including listing X on the command line) will cause Y to be built. In terms of the dependency graph then in essence the dependency on Y is added to all outbound edges from X to those rules that depend on X.\n\nThese types of dependencies are obviously supported by a mechanism in Ninja but I am not sure if Make can generate the appropriate Ninja rules to do this.\n\nWhy can we not just have the platform_systemserverclasspath export a list of the files output produced by dexpreopting and have them be added as explicit dependencies of system.img?",
      "parentUuid": "e1b5392e_e43bc995",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 10
      },
