      "message": "\u003e Soong supports Validation dependencies which should probably be used for this sort of check.\n\nInteresting, first time I hear about Validation dependencies.\n\n\u003e Why can we not just have the platform_systemserverclasspath export a list of the files output produced by dexpreopting and have them be added as explicit dependencies of system.img?\n\nThat\u0027s the simplest option (I forgot about platform_systemserverclasspath, there\u0027s no need for a new singleton). As I understand, it should dump a makefile variable with a list of dependencies, presumably via MakeVars(), and the makefile logic should add it to system.img dependencies.",
